[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_KIRIN_FOREST]
Investigate §YKirin Forest§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_KIRIN_FOREST_desc]
Eastern region is where the most foal’s breath is consumed, and Kirin Forest is where the most foal’s breath is produced. Perhaps starting from the source, we can find some clues.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_KIRIN_FOREST]
调查§Y麒麟之森§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_KIRIN_FOREST_desc]
东部地区是稚马之息消耗最多的地区，麒麟之森则是稚马之息产出最多的地区。也许从源头开始，我们能找到一些线索。
